{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "Opt-in Go, Node or Python callback recovery health, with optional Go/Node actual recovery-worker liveness and latest joined-pass outcomes. Read-only metadata; no callback success or automatic operator action.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Recovery runbook",
      "url": "https://github.com/poyrazK/faas/blob/main/docs/runbooks/GregaleEventRecovery.md",
      "type": "link",
      "targetBlank": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Recovery health: evidence and scope",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Load `recovery.rules.yml`. Each target monitors one owner scope; duplicate observers must not be summed. Backlog panels require a live scrape plus complete, fresh advancing evidence and show Unknown when proof is missing. Count zero covers retained intents only. Parked count can drop after operator resume or supersession without callback confirmation. A Prometheus alert resolution after evidence loss is not proof of recovery; inspect evidence/down/absence alerts. No recovery action is automated. [Operator runbook](https://github.com/poyrazK/faas/blob/main/docs/runbooks/GregaleEventRecovery.md)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Parked callbacks",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Eligible complete retained count. Warning threshold >=1 held 5m. Unknown evidence is not zero.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "gregale_event_recovery:parked{job=~\"${job:regex}\",instance=~\"${instance:regex}\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Parked / {{job}} / {{instance}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Unknown",
          "min": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
